SUMMARY:Bri Bagwell
LOCATION:Cafe Wha?\, Greenwich Village
DESCRIPTION:Texas Female Artist of the Decade and nine-time Female Vocalist
 
 of the Year\, Bri Bagwell is a force to be reckoned with---from her rousin
 
gly fun live performances to her trailblazing recordings\, which have garne
 
red her fifteen #1 singles on Texas Country Radio and counting. People Maga
 
zine raves\, \, "rdquo" -> Bagwell increasingly finds her name being mentio
 
ned amongst country music truth-tellers such as Ashley McBryde and Morgan W
 
ade. Her latest full length album\, Corazón y Cabeza (Heart and Head)\, sp
 
awned three #1 singles: \, "rdquo" -> Trenches\," \, "rdquo" -> Free Man\,"
 
 and \, "rdquo" -> Hello Highway." The video for \, "rdquo" -> Trenches" wa
 
s awarded Music Video of the Year at the Texas Regional Radio Music Awards.
 
 Her #1 release\, \, "rdquo" -> The Rescue\," is a heartfelt dedication to 
 
her dog\, Whiskey\, which received over 200 video and photo submissions fro
 
m fans for the music video---in addition to raising funds for local chariti
 
es in need. Performing 100 shows a year\, Bri has shared the stage with a l
 
ong list of esteemed artists\, including Willie Nelson\, Miranda Lambert\, 
 
Robert Earl Keen\, Kacey Musgraves\, Reckless Kelly\, and Dwight Yoakam. Ca
 
tch Bri Bagwell live on tour or listen to her top-charting podcast\, ONLY V
 
ANS\, at bribagwell.com. Please Note: Two Item Minimum Per Attendee. All Sa
 
les Final Tickets & info: https://www.ticketweb.com/event/bri-bagwell-cafe-
 
wha-tickets/14927763
URL:https://www.ticketweb.com/event/bri-bagwell-cafe-wha-tickets/14927763
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:nyc-20261117-13@tonight
DTSTAMP:20261112T060505Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261117T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261117T210000
SUMMARY:A Ghost in Your Ear
LOCATION:Audible's Minetta Lane Theatre\, Greenwich Village
DESCRIPTION:When an actor arrives late to a sound studio for a last-minute 
 
audiobook recording session\, he is handed the script of a chilling ghost s
 
tory to read. But as the engineer cues the recording and the evening wears 
 
on\, the horrors slowly begin to escape the page to haunt the studio itself
 
. Fresh from an acclaimed\, sold-out run in London\, A GHOST IN YOUR EAR is
 
 the "truly terrifying headphone horror" (The Guardian) from the darkly bri
 
lliant mind of Tony Award® nominee Jamie Armitage (SIX)\, made in collabor
 
ation with Ben and Max Ringham (ANNA\, National Theatre). A mesmerizing ble
 
nd of gothic horror and psychological thriller\, this cutting-edge theatric
 
al experience uses groundbreaking binaural sound technology to immerse ever
 
y audience member in a haunting world of sound. And at Audible's Minetta La
 
ne Theatre - one of New York's most intimate venues - there's no escaping t
 
he frights. Enter if you dare. Tickets & info: https://www.ticketmaster.com
 
/a-ghost-in-your-ear-new-york-new-york-11-17-2026/event/300064F5DFBFA376
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/a-ghost-in-your-ear-new-york-new-york-11-1
 
7-2026/event/300064F5DFBFA376
END:VEVENT
