SUMMARY:The Conversation
LOCATION:Astor Place Theatre\, Greenwich Village
DESCRIPTION:THE CONVERSATION follows Marcus (Tony Award-winner Joshua Henry
 
) and Elle (Julia Harriman) from the electric spark of their first date to 
 
move-ins\, milestones\, and the slow accumulation of everything left unsaid
 
. The score\, written by Henry and Harriman\, weaves soul\, R&B\, and moder
 
n pop into bold musical theater storytelling that is intimate\, honest\, an
 
d emotionally gripping. With a book by Nick Green and directed by Tony Awar
 
d-winner Kenny Leon\, The Conversation asks what it takes to choose love\, 
 
even when it hurts\, and what it takes to stay. Tickets & info: https://www
 
.ticketmaster.com/the-conversation-new-york-new-york-11-17-2026/event/03006
 
51FC7CF17A4
